# Bomach OS Port Rules

- Read AGENTS.md and the porting documents before implementation.
- Preserve the Flutter Company and HR screens as the visual and behavior reference. This work is a port, not a redesign.
- Standardize form, loading, empty, error, success, and permission behavior according to docs/porting/interaction-standards.md.
- Keep the work in this repository. Do not modify the sibling Flutter reference or separately owned standalone app repositories.
- Verify API contracts before implementing. Do not guess endpoint paths, payloads, or permission names.
- Keep shared UI generic; keep Company and HR domain logic in their own modules.
- The user decides product behavior; Codex implements the agreed changes incrementally and keeps the porting documents current.
